			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1433897">
									

<p>I am in love with this concept. I love the whole story except for one bit. I understand that it's meant to be a rivalry, but the idea that 1454 doesn't like 1454's &quot;others&quot; contrasts with the idea that they don't ever attempt to reconcile their existence.</p>
